Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.07,0:22:44.74,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}I will I'll be me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.74,0:22:47.42,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}I will I'll be me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.42,0:22:49.87,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}亮出利爪的那些傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.87,0:22:52.62,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}又想要用它去守護誰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.62,0:22:54.65,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}武器既可傷害也能保護
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.65,0:22:58.02,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}人生不正如這般的雙向交流嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.02,0:23:03.40,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}就算約定似隱似現 無人再能知曉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.40,0:23:07.90,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}也要一心遵守 度過烈火焦灼夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.90,0:23:10.67,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}無知狂笑著引人注目
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.67,0:23:13.37,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}任昔日萬象掌舵方向
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.37,0:23:16.79,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}情緒染上呼出的濕氣
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.79,0:23:19.29,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}我無意在一無所知中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.29,0:23:21.00,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}讓它們被你掌控
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.00,0:23:25.98,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}審視腦內想像後回歸自我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.98,0:23:32.51,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}正解的逼迫是渴望將我吞食殆盡的惡魔
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.51,0:23:36.76,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}別再繼續阻擋我的道路了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.76,0:23:44.48,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\bord3\blur4}我絕不會被你所描繪出的理想扼殺
