Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.37,0:02:47.58,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}你是覺得自己一直在贏
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.58,0:02:49.69,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}但惡魔馬上就會來見你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.69,0:02:53.53,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}你知道他為什麼想要你的靈魂 對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.55,0:02:57.52,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}你那扭曲的欲望 把我們拖入了混亂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.52,0:03:01.55,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}誤入歧途 分道揚鑣 一去不回
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.55,0:03:05.57,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}你點了把火 眼看它燒毀一切
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.57,0:03:08.94,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}像你常做的那樣 試圖自救吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.18,0:03:11.89,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}我們建起的每座橋樑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.89,0:03:14.45,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}你都占為己有又付之一炬
