Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.77,0:03:22.65,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}你才會想傾聆我們的聲音
